Title: "Title"
Id: "d91e97b6-8d9b-4932-9e77-f62c3ff9e6d0"

Text: "`Title:` is a top-level page title block.

```mlg-fragment
Title: \"Foundations of Set Theory\"
Id: \"23e4567e-e89b-42d3-a456-426614174000\"
```

It renders directly on the page, not inside a card. It does not take a bracket heading."
Id: "4783c081-2028-43c5-93c2-c38b09945066"
